{"seq":2,"slug":"paths-shapes","title":"路径与形状","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webgl-canvas-rendering/canvas2d/paths-shapes","wordCount":1342,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"路径与形状\">路径与形状</h1><p>Canvas 2D 里没有「画一条线」这种一步到位的东西。你要先<strong>描述</strong>一条路径——由若干直线段、曲线段拼成的几何轮廓——再<strong>决定</strong>如何呈现它：用 <code>fill</code> 灌满内部，还是用 <code>stroke</code> 勾出边缘。这种「先建路径、后定呈现」的两段式设计，是 Canvas 矢量绘图的全部精髓，也是新手最容易踩坑的地方（忘了 <code>beginPath</code> 导致上一帧的线残留到这一帧）。这篇文档把路径的构建、填充规则、曲线与可复用的 <code>Path2D</code> 讲透。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-路径是一个独立于状态的缓冲\">核心概念：路径是一个独立于状态的缓冲</h2><p>上一篇 <a href=\"drawing-context\">绘图上下文与状态机</a> 强调过：当前路径<strong>不属于</strong>绘图状态，<code>save</code>/<code>restore</code> 管不了它。它更像上下文里一个独立的「路径缓冲区」，你用一系列命令往里追加子路径，再用呈现命令消费它。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[beginPath 清空路径缓冲] --&gt; B[moveTo 起一个子路径]&#10;  B --&gt; C[lineTo/arc/bezierCurveTo 追加段]&#10;  C --&gt; D{closePath 可选闭合}&#10;  D --&gt; E[fill 填充内部]&#10;  D --&gt; F[stroke 描出轮廓]&#10;  D --&gt; G[clip 设为裁剪区]&#10;  E --&gt; H[路径仍在缓冲, 可再次消费]&#10;  F --&gt; H\">flowchart TD\n  A[beginPath 清空路径缓冲] --&gt; B[moveTo 起一个子路径]\n  B --&gt; C[lineTo/arc/bezierCurveTo 追加段]\n  C --&gt; D{closePath 可选闭合}\n  D --&gt; E[fill 填充内部]\n  D --&gt; F[stroke 描出轮廓]\n  D --&gt; G[clip 设为裁剪区]\n  E --&gt; H[路径仍在缓冲, 可再次消费]\n  F --&gt; H</pre><p>三类命令各司其职。<strong>路径构建命令</strong>（<code>moveTo</code>、<code>lineTo</code>、<code>arc</code>、<code>quadraticCurveTo</code>、<code>bezierCurveTo</code>、<code>rect</code>、<code>arcTo</code>）往缓冲里追加几何。<strong>呈现命令</strong>（<code>fill</code>、<code>stroke</code>、<code>clip</code>）读取整个缓冲并产生像素。<strong>控制命令</strong>里最关键的是 <code>beginPath()</code>——它清空缓冲，开始全新一段。忘记调用它，后果是所有历史路径在每次 <code>stroke</code> 时被反复重绘，画面越来越糊、性能越来越差。这是 Canvas 动画里最经典的 bug。</p>\n<h2 id=\"子路径与填充规则\">子路径与填充规则</h2><p>一条路径可以包含多个<strong>子路径</strong>：每次 <code>moveTo</code> 或 <code>closePath</code> 后再画，就开了一个新子路径。<code>fill</code> 会把所有子路径当成一个整体来填充，而「内部」的判定依赖<strong>填充规则</strong>。Canvas 支持两种：<code>nonzero</code>（非零环绕，默认）和 <code>evenodd</code>（奇偶）。</p>\n<p>对于「洞」——比如一个甜甜圈形状（外圆套内圆）——两种规则给出不同结果。非零环绕规则对一点向外引射线，统计路径穿过射线的有符号次数（顺时针 +1、逆时针 -1），和不为零则算内部；奇偶规则只数穿越次数，奇数算内部。要挖出中间的洞，非零规则要求内外两圈<strong>方向相反</strong>，奇偶规则则不在乎方向。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sgn</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>crossing</mtext><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>P</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>内部</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>nonzero</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>穿越次数为奇</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>evenodd</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w(P)=\\sum_{k} \\operatorname{sgn}(\\text{crossing}_k),\\quad P\\in\\text{内部}\\iff\n\\begin{cases} w(P)\\neq 0 &amp; \\text{nonzero}\\\\ \\text{穿越次数为奇} &amp; \\text{evenodd}\\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3521em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">sgn</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">crossing</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7073em;vertical-align:-0.024em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">内部</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">穿越次数为奇</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">nonzero</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">evenodd</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"ctx.beginPath();&#10;ctx.arc(100, 100, 60, 0, Math.PI * 2); // 外圈，顺时针&#10;ctx.arc(100, 100, 30, 0, Math.PI * 2, true); // 内圈，逆时针（true=逆）&#10;ctx.fill(&#39;nonzero&#39;); // 方向相反 → 中间挖空成环\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">beginPath</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">arc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">60</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, Math.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">PI</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 外圈，顺时针</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">arc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, Math.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">PI</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 内圈，逆时针（true=逆）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fill</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'nonzero'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 方向相反 → 中间挖空成环</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>fill 填充</th>\n<th>stroke 描边</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>作用对象</td>\n<td>路径围成的内部区域</td>\n<td>路径的轮廓线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关键状态</td>\n<td><code>fillStyle</code>、填充规则</td>\n<td><code>strokeStyle</code>、<code>lineWidth</code>、<code>lineJoin</code>、<code>lineCap</code>、<code>setLineDash</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>开放路径行为</td>\n<td>隐式闭合后填充</td>\n<td>按原样描边，不自动闭合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型用途</td>\n<td>实心形状、区域</td>\n<td>边框、连线、虚线</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>描边这一侧的细节值得留意：<code>lineWidth</code> 会被当前变换矩阵缩放（<code>scale(2,2)</code> 后 1px 的线会变成 2px 宽），<code>lineJoin</code>（<code>miter</code>/<code>round</code>/<code>bevel</code>）决定拐角形态，<code>setLineDash([6,4])</code> 配合 <code>lineDashOffset</code> 能做虚线和蚂蚁线动画。</p>\n<h2 id=\"曲线-二次与三次贝塞尔\">曲线：二次与三次贝塞尔</h2><p>直线段之外，路径的表现力来自贝塞尔曲线。<code>quadraticCurveTo(cpx, cpy, x, y)</code> 用一个控制点画二次曲线，<code>bezierCurveTo(cp1x, cp1y, cp2x, cp2y, x, y)</code> 用两个控制点画三次曲线——后者正是矢量设计工具里那对「手柄」的数学本体。三次贝塞尔曲线由起点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、两个控制点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_1,P_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、终点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 参数化定义：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>3</mn></msup><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn